title Vinyl P2a: the sleep timer runs while Vinyl is hidden (X-Background=run): a 15-minute timer with 2 s left, hidden, it ends while hidden (the music paused), shown again: the notice, a full repaint, close quits
sizes 640x480
ppmm 901
lifecycle
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP 15
env VINYL_DEMO_SLEEP_LEFT 2

wait 600
shot 01-now-before
hide
wait 2500
expect hidden
expect nowrite
show
wait 400
expect visible
expect repaint
shot 02-now-after
expect text "Sleep timer ended. Paused."
close
expect quit
